<title>USA: Chefs International sells Mr. Cookie Face.</title>
<headline>Chefs International sells Mr. Cookie Face.</headline>
<dateline>POINT PLEASANT BEACH, N.J. 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chefs International Inc said on Thursday it completed the sale of its Mister Cookie Face Inc subsidiary to Frank &quot;Doc&quot; Koenemund for $500,000 in cash and promissory notes for $1.1 million.</p>
<p>Koenemund, who is a Chefs International director, acquired 95 percent of Mister Cookie Face stock.</p>
<p>The sale proceeds enabled Chefs to retire the outstanding revolving line of credit it incurred to fund Mister Cookie Face operations.</p>
<p>Mister Cookie Face makes and distributes ice cream products.</p>
<p>	  ((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
